  "description": "NIPLEE crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C132 H98 N2 O24 Yb4,6(C7 H8). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.595-3.751 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 93.93-110.32°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Yb4(μ3-OH)2(Ph2acac)8(o-O2NC6H4O)2]·6C7H8. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
